Output assets/n2-mesh-demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 420
Set Shell bash
Set Theme "Dracula"
Type "n2-mesh create --room rust-devs"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "   ✓ Room created · WebRTC signaling"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# Serverless P2P chat · WebRTC · zero dependencies"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
